      "explanation": "There are six identical addends \\(6^6\\), so their sum is \\(6\\cdot6^6\\). Multiplication of powers with the same base adds the exponents:\n\\[\n6\\cdot6^6=6^1\\cdot6^6=6^{1+6}=6^7.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(\\boxed{6^7}\\), choice B.",
